<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM REVISES DOWN 1996 NET.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM REVISES DOWN 1996 NET.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrim preliminary results for</p>
<p>the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			38.38 vs   30.36</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 182.55 vs  199.58</p>
<p>    net profit				40.33 vs   51.87</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Elektrim SA. Earlier the</p>
<p>company said its net profit for 1996 was 49.78 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales				894.82 vs  618.41</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 765.19 vs  524.88</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.10 vs    0.01 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				64.70 vs   70.75</p>
<p>    other taxes			     77.52 vs   76.96</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   324.83 vs  275.55</p>
<p>    financial costs			183.87 vs  108.53</p>
<p>    investment				56.17 vs   49.27</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
